{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25506","headline":"余所居平泉村舍近蒙韦常侍大尹特改嘉名因寄诗以谢 · 李德裕","name":"余所居平泉村舍近蒙韦常侍大尹特改嘉名因寄诗以谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未谢留侯疾，常怀仲蔚园。\n闲谣紫芝曲，归梦赤松村。\n忽改蓬蒿色，俄吹黍谷暄。\n多慙孔北海，传教及衡门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}